  DisplayName: Cholera in the Port Cities
  EventType: 1
  Description: Cholera {has broken|is feared to break} out in the port cities, and
    ships from abroad {are held|will be held} in quarantine. Old carpets and hangings
    {are|will be} suspected of carrying the contagion, and few buyers {are willing|will
    be willing} to go near them.
